{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>You shall not fear them.</b> Even though He is speaking to Joshua, He used the plural form to include all of Israel as well — to say that not even one of Israel should fear them, for HaShem fights for them. And according to what I explained regarding ״לֵאמֹר״ as referring to Israel, He used language indicating that he should speak it to Israel, that they should trust in the living Elohim." "<b>Thus is concluded the parashah of Devarim.</b>"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:14:36.445527502Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}